 calm expression. Behind her, a modern convenience store has a bright illuminated sign that clearly reads \"便利店\", while a large digital billboard across the street displays \"QWEN IMAGE 2.1\" in clean white letters. Several pedestrians walk through the background with umbrellas, and wet asphalt reflects the red, blue, and warm yellow city lights. The scene has a cinematic street-photography composition, with the woman sharply in focus and the background gradually falling into soft bokeh. Cool blue ambient light mixes with warm storefront lighting, creating natural reflections on the wet surfaces. The overall composition feels like a realistic photograph captured on a rainy Tokyo evening, with balanced visual depth and a strong contrast between the subject and the colorful urban background."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(21, 23, 27, 0.96)", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [818.8983764648438, 2509.27197265625], "id": 483, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# Resolution Selector\n\n用于根据**宽高比、目标像素量和倍数**自动计算输出分辨率。\n\n* **Aspect Ratio**：设置输出宽高比。\n* **Megapixels**：设置目标总像素量，`1 MP ≈ 1024×1024`。\n* **Multiple**：设置宽、高需要对齐的倍数，最终分辨率会调整为该倍数的整数倍。\n* **Preview**：显示当前设置对应的实际输出分辨率。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [429.7633056640625, 224.3246307373047], "pos": [347.249267578125, 2267.1748046875], "id": 484, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [683], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [394.6466064453125, 100.6246566772461], "pos": [1390, 2270], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name